    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game \u201cSparky: Hills of Death\u201d recently de<u>V</u>eloped by Hito Corporation, players are <u>I</u>mmersed in a dark universe designed by Sam Wills. The protagonist Sparky, <u>C</u>omes to life in a sinis<u>T</u>er way transcending the b<u>O</u>undaries between <u>R</u>eality and the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960610/extras/f7dcf8077ed1f695cd9c5c70ae1f6f6e.poster.avif?t=1736686070\" width=538 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960610/extras/f7dcf8077ed1f695cd9c5c70ae1f6f6e.webm?t=1736686070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960610/extras/f7dcf8077ed1f695cd9c5c70ae1f6f6e.mp4?t=1736686070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zac a virtual security expert, finds himself immersed in this nightmare, while Marina his girlfriend, observes peculiar events in the real world related to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The distinction between the virtual and the real disappears, leading players to a startling experience in which they must unravel enigmas, confront their fears and uncover the mysteries hidden in the Hills of Death. The horror tangibly materializes in 2024.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960610/extras/63595931252313e6f056f7d348d7bed8.poster.avif?t=1736686070\" width=538 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960610/extras/63595931252313e6f056f7d348d7bed8.webm?t=1736686070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960610/extras/63595931252313e6f056f7d348d7bed8.mp4?t=1736686070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the Character with the WASD keys on your keyboard and using the Mouse to move the camera, you must escape the location while there are enemies behind you, as the game progresses, look for items to survive, such as flashlights with batteries, places to stay hidden and much more!<br><br><br><strong><i>CHAPTER 1 - Virus awakened</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this first part of the story, Zac tests a mysterious game developed by Hito Corporation. The game, apparently defective, is gradually taken over by a virus that corrupts the entire system! Sparky the monster escapes his digital prison once again. Zac then finds himself trapped in illusions controlled by Sparky and must find a way to escape this dark trap! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the offices where <u>Spaky</u> rules</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Run to survive</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Use scene items to defend yourself or hide  </i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sparky is waiting for you...</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
